flowchart TB
    Employee[Invited Google account] -->|Sign in| Auth[Supabase Auth Google identity]
    Auth --> App[React HandoffCheck app]
    Employee -->|Verified Google email and feature fields| Form[Google Forms]
    Form -->|Raw responses| Sheet[Private Google Sheets tracking]
    Form -->|Installable submit trigger| Script[Owner operated Apps Script]
    Script -->|Timestamp nonce and HMAC SHA256| Bridge[Supabase workspace-bridge]
    Bridge -->|Active membership and canonical create RPC| DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    DB -->|Imported draft| App
    App -->|Author edits and two distinct lead approvals| DB
    App -->|Generate approved brief| DB
    DB -->|Stored approved Markdown only| Script
    Script -->|Private file with stable brief ID| Docs[Google Docs in private Drive folder]
    Script -->|Five minute status and questions mirror| Sheet
    Script -->|Document ID and approved content hash| Bridge
    DB -->|Authenticated Doc link and connection settings| App
